{
  "name": "諸神之盔 Helm of the Gods",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/equipment/head/helm-barbute-horned-gold-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID:15.6pt none\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">戴上這個頭盔的時候，你可以知道在你<span>30</span>尺範圍內是否有天界生物或邪魔，以及該生物所在的位置，前提是該生物不處於全掩護狀態。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">每當你戴着頭盔完成長休息時，你可以向諸神之盔表上所列的一個神明祈禱，並將所列的法術儲存在頭盔中，取代任何已經儲存在那裏的法術。法術的豁免<span>DC</span>爲<span>13</span>。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">頭盔有<span>3</span>發充能。要從頭盔中施放一個法術，你必須消耗<span>1</span>發充能，頭盔每天黎明時恢復<span>1d3</span>發充能。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">法術列表：</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.IuzXxwP3EhWGhtXC]{防護善惡}（雅睿歐斯<span>Athreos</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.FbxdKcDpSPWuGTLA]{庇護術}（厄芳拉<span>Ephara</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.Fl4lOWHo82WLp3g7]{造成輕傷}（厄睿柏斯<span>Erebos</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.PHYXwNkXSdJjDCSD]{曳光彈}（赫利歐德<span>Heliod</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.eatsvLyUqyzEFzCv]{英勇氣概}（伊洛安斯<span>Iroas</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.AmuFE4xAoWlzjjQU]{神莓}（卡拉美特拉<span>Karametra</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.Nnlg7rIKGf7VMWRl]{雷鳴斬}（刻拉諾斯<span>Keranos</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.NZ4JOGBMJzeCKT5O]{糾纏術}（克洛緹絲<span>Klothys</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.j8wwbcc1tlY9hLRf]{不諧低語}（克羅芬斯<span>Kruphix </span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.Qh8PTvCxR44isqVO]{煉獄叱喝}（墨癸斯<span>Mogis</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.sLkNbDcU39qcVt14]{妖火}（倪勒婭<span>Nylea</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.I1C2EQxwynPd7dOC]{次級復原術}（芳瑞卡<span>Pharika</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.QFBZcGORjnBRgAYo]{魅惑人類}（斐納克<span>Phenax</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.73yB6CHxGk3Np5ME]{熾焰斬}（普羅烽斯<span>Purphoros</span>）</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.tyshE8ZcV1Xniej3]{鑑定術}（塔薩<span>Thassa</span>）</p></div>",
